  <item>
    <title>Vol.003 劳动节特辑｜阴间是什么样？大概就是公司那样吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662e01755fb33c1b2b151136</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662e01755fb33c1b2b151136</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Apr 2024 07:57:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>早订阅，晚享受！</span><br><span>魔法披风又更新啦，本期我们选择在调休班这天激情更新，原因很简单……</span><br><span>当然是给即将到来的五一助助兴！</span><br><span> </span><br><span>咳咳咳…下面我们进入正题。</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpo_cNoTQE-irsd6G4TA85j2qlOY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>今天我们聊聊</span><strong><span>职场灵异事件</span></strong><span>。2002年有一部港片叫《Office有鬼》，由陈小春、冯德伦、莫文蔚、舒淇、苑琼丹等主演。</span><br><span>尽管这部影片还是比较常见恐怖片套路，但对比之下，今天大家好像已经失去了影片中那种对办公楼的奇思怪想了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可能是被职场磨平了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个人怎么才能做到不怕鬼，树立科学意识？最好的办法就是进入职场。</span><br><span>过上几年你就会发现，什么妖魔鬼怪、灵异事件，</span><strong><span>老子在公司里见得多了</span></strong><span>！</span><br><span>根本不需要大惊小怪！</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS：本期涉及大量阴间笑话，心脏脆弱者慎点</span></p><span></span><p><span>⬇ ⬇ ⬇ ⬇ ⬇ ⬇</span></p><span></span><h2><span>- 时间轴 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a> 真好用啊~职场替死鬼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="515">08:35</a> 我，怨气很重（我和鬼出现在同一个地方，高僧来了会超度我那种）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> 打工人生存秘技：无视的艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 赐我一套凶宅吧，很大的那种！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2693">44:53</a> &nbsp;避免内耗，我和同事沟通都用 ChatGPT</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3164">52:44</a> 大家还是好好活着吧</span></p><span></span><h2><span>- 主播 -</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>晴天霹雳柱</span></strong><br><span>新媒体运营人</span><br><span>wb</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7736811927" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7736811927"><span>@芝士年糕培根堡</span></a><br><span>xhs</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65c440fa000000000903ef3a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65c440fa000000000903ef3a&amp;apptime=1711601120" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65c440fa000000000903ef3a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65c440fa000000000903ef3a&amp;apptime=1711601120"><span>@柱柱柱🍔</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>赵盼盼不发疯</span></strong><br><span>财经撰稿人</span><br><span>wb</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5874057145" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5874057145"><span>@大麦茶有理想</span></a><br><span>xhs</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/603978c6000000000100b531?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65c440fa000000000903ef3a&amp;apptime=1711601555" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/603978c6000000000100b531?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65c440fa000000000903ef3a&amp;apptime=1711601555"><span>@赵盼盼</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>- 往期内容逐字稿 -</span></h2><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ug8FNwWZnxLqJUxcghImTg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ug8FNwWZnxLqJUxcghImTg"><span>为华语电影挽尊的，怎么是这个“流氓”？</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WrO5gvuDqv-W-BxLDMCF_g" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/WrO5gvuDqv-W-BxLDMCF_g"><span>宫崎骏新作：人生本就是难解的谜团</span></a></h1><span></span><h2><span>- 关于魔法披风Don't freak out！-</span></h2><span></span><p><span>早订阅，晚享受！</span><br><span>电影佳作深度解读，发疯作品不定期吐槽。</span><br><span>送你一件魔法披风，祝你情绪稳定不发疯。 </span><br><span>感谢大家的收听，欢迎大家关注我们节目的官方微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7909537524" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7909537524"><span>@魔法披风_DontFreakOut</span></a></p>]]></description>
