  <item>
    <title>Vol.001 聊到《周处除三害》，我们当即决定开个播客……</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6604fe4a2d9eae5d0a89cae9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6604fe4a2d9eae5d0a89cae9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 05:21:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>早订阅，晚享受！</span><br><span>本期是电影《周处除三害》的漫谈，</span><br><span>两位主创在看完本片后发现这是一部难得的极具解读深度的华语电影。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，真的不来听听看这两个</span><em><strong><span>「播客小学生」</span></strong></em><span>第一期都聊了啥吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>⬇️ ⬇️ ⬇️ ⬇️ ⬇️ ⬇️</span></p><span></span><h2><span>- 时间轴 -</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 四年前一句劝诫，竟成了回旋镖！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 「魔法披风」取名大揭秘！真相竟是……？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> 详细中透着一丝散漫的</span><strong><span>电影主创介绍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a> 陈桂林原型：「双面杀手」 刘焕荣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 电影内在的东方式逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 痴 - 陈桂林：电影中猪的代表人物，一个儿童心智的纯真恶人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> 嗔 - 香港仔：电影中蛇的代表人物，狡猾、冷酷、不信任任何人，却总需要一个理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2491">41:31</a> 贪 - 尊者（林禄和） ：鸽子在东西方宗教中的不同象征意义，让这个角色讽刺性拉满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2896">48:16</a> 柱女士现场道破PUA本质！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 山上彻也与沉迷邪教的母亲——小宝母子的现实映射</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3073">51:13</a> 禅宗的解脱：人确实需要一些超然的态度。但是欲望很难通过压抑来解决。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">58:52</a> 《周处除三害》的成功真的只是因为血腥暴力吗？这部电影是如何在一个规规矩矩的犯罪片框架下，完成对传统叙事的解构的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3977">01:06:17</a> 镜头语言——尊者女人：萧湘湘的宗教狂热幻梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4302">01:11:42</a> 电影借鉴了港片元素，但也颠覆了传统黑帮电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4584">01:16:24</a> 《无间道》与《黑社会》，身份的丧失和道德信念的崩塌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4807">01:20:07</a> 上街发糖、遵纪守法、偷西瓜，日本黑帮弟弟行为大赏</span></p><span></span><h2><span>主播</span></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>晴天霹雳柱，新媒体运营人</span></strong><br><span>wb</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7736811927" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7736811927"><span>@芝士年糕培根堡</span></a><br><span>xhs</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65c440fa000000000903ef3a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65c440fa000000000903ef3a&amp;apptime=1711601120" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65c440fa000000000903ef3a?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65c440fa000000000903ef3a&amp;apptime=1711601120"><span>@柱柱柱🍔</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>赵盼盼不发疯，财经撰稿人</span></strong><br><span>wb</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5874057145" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5874057145"><span>@大麦茶有理想</span></a><br><span>xhs</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/603978c6000000000100b531?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65c440fa000000000903ef3a&amp;apptime=1711601555" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/603978c6000000000100b531?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=65c440fa000000000903ef3a&amp;apptime=1711601555"><span>@赵盼盼</span></a></p><span></span><h2><span>- 关于 魔法披风Don't freak out！-</span></h2><span></span><p><span>感谢大家的收听，欢迎大家关注我们节目的官方微博</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7909537524" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7909537524"><span>@魔法披风_DontFreakOut</span></a></p>]]></description>
